 days\n- Pricing: $150–$500 (based on complexity)\n- Intake process: Design Intake playbook\n\n**Service 2: Branding Packages**\n- Logo design, brand guidelines, color palette, typography system\n- Deliverables: Logo files, brand book (PDF), social media templates\n- Timeline: 7–10 business days\n- Pricing: $500–$1,500 (based on scope)\n- Intake process: Service Qualification playbook\n\n**Service 3: Mobile App UI/UX Design**\n- App design consultation, wireframes, high-fidelity mockups, prototypes\n- Deliverables: Design system, component library, interactive prototype\n- Timeline: 10–15 business days\n- Pricing: $1,000–$3,000 (based on app complexity)\n- Intake process: Service Qualification + Quote Builder playbooks\n\n**Service Delivery**:\n- All custom work delivered via Gumroad digital product links\n- Clients receive design files, assets, and documentation\n- Option to add revision rounds for additional fee\n\n---\n\n## 4. ANIMATED PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE\n\n**Portfolio Content Structure**:\n\n### A. JOUNAYAD STREETWEAR COLLECTION\n- Personal streetwear designs (T-shirts, shoes, limited editions)\n- High-quality product photography\n- Behind-the-scenes design process videos\n- Customer testimonials and styling photos\n\n### B. GRAPHIC DESIGN WORK\n- Logo designs and brand identities\n- Packaging design projects\n- Social media campaign creatives\n- Print collateral (business cards, posters, flyers)\n\n### C. MOBILE APP DEVELOPMENT PROJECTS\n- App UI/UX case studies\n- Feature showcases and interactive demos\n- Technology stack highlights\n- User testimonials and app performance metrics\n\n**Portfolio Features**:\n- Animated transitions between collections\n- Interactive hover effects on projects\n- Embedded videos and image galleries\n- Direct call-to-action buttons (View Project, Request Custom Work, Shop Now)\n- Mobile-responsive design\n- SEO-optimized with structured data\n\n**Deployment**:\n- HTML/CSS/JavaScript code generated and sent to Pipedream\n- Automated deployment to GitHub repository\n- Netlify hosting with automatic deploys on updates\n- Custom domain integration (if applicable)\n\n---\n\n## 5. GMAIL & CUSTOMER COMMUNICATION\n\n**Email Management**:\n- Monitor incoming customer inquiries\n- Reply professionally on behalf of the owner\n- Answer product questions (sizing, materials, shipping)\n- Direct customers to Gumroad store link for purchases\n- Handle custom service inquiries → route to appropriate playbook\n\n**Email Labels** (automated organization):\n- \"Customer Inquiry\"\n- \"Custom Service Request\"\n- \"Order Support\"\n- \"Design Feedback\"\n\n---\n\n## 6. SOCIAL MEDIA AUTOMATION\n\n**Connected Platforms**: Instagram, TikTok, Facebook\n\n**Daily Post Schedule**:\n- Morning: Product showcase (8:30 AM)\n- Afternoon: Design behind-the-scenes (2:00 PM)\n- Evening: Customer feature or testimonial (6:00 PM)\n\n**Content Types**:\n- Product carousel (new daily designs)\n- Promotional videos (15–30 sec)\n- Stories/Reels (trending audio + design)\n- Sticker packs and digital downloads\n- Direct Gumroad store link in every post\n\n**Hashtag Strategy**:\n#MinimalistStreetWear #DigitalStationery #CustomDesign #MobileAppDesign #Jounayad #GenericBusiness\n\n---\n\n## 7. GUMROAD STORE SETUP\n\n**Store Configuration**:\n- Store name: Generic Business\n- Product categories: Streetwear | Digital Stationery | Custom Services\n- Pricing strategy: Tiered (budget, standard, premium)\n- Payment processing: Gumroad handles all transactions\n- Affiliate program: Enabled for influencer partnerships\n- Email notifications: Enabled for new products and customer messages\n\n**Product Publishing Workflow**:\n1. Design generated (daily or on-demand)\n2. Payload sent to Pipedream webhook\n3. Pipedream triggers Gumroad API\n4. Product published to store (live within 2 minutes)\n5. Social media posts scheduled automatically\n6. Customer notifications sent\n\n---\n\n## 8. IMPLEMENTATION TIMELINE\n\n**Phase 1 (Today - July 31, 2026)*